        "Background": "Shadowman is feared across the galaxy for the ruin he leaves behind, though his rampage may be less random than it looks. He was once Har Grimoire, an acclaimed scientist devoted to his daughter Elle, until a lab accident killed her and nearly killed him. Thought dead, he rebuilt himself inside armor that both keeps him alive and makes him more than human, and set out to find OVA — an outlawed project to rebuild a person from a single DNA sample, which he's sure still exists somewhere. He'll let nothing stop him."
