        "Background": "Shadowman: Attacks\nLaser Sword: A glowing beam of light that instills fear into those who would dare face him.\nPsycho-Kinetic Crush: Shadowman uses his amplified mental powers to toss around the opponent.\n\nShadowman: Character Hooks\nHe's an obvious enemy for Karis, but anyone protecting the common good can end up opposing him. Curiously, Karis looks a great deal like Elle."
